XSUS Technical Architecture

Project: XSUS Studio
System: XSUS AI Core
Status: Initial architecture specification
Version: 0.1.0

---

1. Purpose

This document defines the intended technical architecture of XSUS AI Core.

The objective is to establish a modular foundation for multilingual AI, knowledge retrieval, model execution, security, and future XSUS-owned model development.

This specification describes the target architecture. Individual components must be implemented and tested before they are considered operational.

2. Architectural Overview

XSUS AI Core is organized into the following logical layers:

1. Product and interface layer.
2. API and request validation layer.
3. Orchestration and context layer.
4. Language and knowledge services.
5. Model abstraction and execution layer.
6. Data and storage layer.
7. Security and observability layer.

The architecture must prevent product-specific code from becoming tightly coupled to a particular AI model or provider.

